(exclude ($UniqueValley $GroundColorFromLayout) "Under $LowestSky with $EverySky, no case reads the ground color. A case that takes $UniqueValley and another branch gives the output of the same case with a tie-breaking valley branch wherever it is defined, so the concept case alone takes $UniqueValley.")
